{"title": "Artificial Sight", "pageid": 30481, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Artificial_Sight", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Artificial Sight</b> is a passive feature which lets the user see even when blinded.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer can see in the dark up to 12 m (40 ft) and cannot be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Steelwatcher_Helmet\" title=\"Steelwatcher Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Steelwatcher_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Steelwatcher_Helmet\" title=\"Steelwatcher Helmet\">Steel Watcher Helmet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Artificial Sight blocks any condition under the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(status_group)\" title=\"Blinded (status group)\">Blinded</a></span> status group, not just Blinded.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Artificial Sight does not provide the cone of light one would otherwise get by obtaining the Darkvision effect from a different source, such as a spell or having the passive innately through race. It also allows the wearer to see through <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness_(cloud)\" title=\"Darkness (cloud)\">magical darkness</a>, despite not stating such in the description.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201919\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1311/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11359/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4183/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.009/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 818039/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.593      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   41.593      1 -total\n 31.51%   13.106      1 Template:Cond\n 23.48%    9.767      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 22.96%    9.551      2 Template:Icon_text\n 21.79%    9.062     10 Template:Trim\n 21.51%    8.948      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 20.56%    8.553      1 Template:Icon_link\n 18.81%    7.823      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 18.42%    7.660      4 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30481-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201919 and revision id 374893. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}